  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Project Parameters**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on the initial project specifications. My understanding is that I need to build a high-end, full landpage in React for a psychologist, Dr. Bruno de Oliveira Lima, using a specific visual identity. I\'m taking the client\'s preference for dark backgrounds, elegant gold details, refined typography, and a luxury feel into account. A logo will also be a key component. I will be sure to integrate these components for a polished result.\n\n\n**Refining Technical Specifications**\n\nI\'m now diving into the technical specifics. I\'ve noted the \"\316\250\" symbol and circular layout for the logo, aligning with the dark/gold aesthetic and visual style. The project entails a client-only React landing page, a single-screen layout, and a direct WhatsApp link. I\'m focusing on smooth animations and elegant typography, including outstanding testimonials. I am double-checking that image handling and structure will meet the high standards of the design guide.\n\n\n**Defining Client Deliverables**\n\nI\'ve decided on the scope for Dr. Lima\'s React landing page: it will be a client-side single page app. No custom backend is required unless we integrate the Gemini API, which is unlikely as the user gave us specific content. It will feature localized Portuguese copy, interactive elements, self-care exercises, and a simulated self-assessment. A polished, high-end design with elegant components is now my main priority. I will implement a scrollable page for a psychologist. The images are of a man named Bruno de Oliveira with a beard, in front of a luxury matte-black panel wall. The gold logo must be implemented.\n\n\n**Incorporating Visual Elements**\n\nI\'m now integrating new image considerations. Specifically, I need to incorporate diverse images of families and couples reflecting emotional healing and connection (images 3-8), along with the high-resolution logo (image 9). I\'m also examining the PsyMeet profile screenshot (image 10) to elegantly present consultation information while maintaining the high-end design. I\'m focusing on the \"Sobre mim\" text, incorporating the psychologist\'s Cognitive Behavioral Therapy approach and integrated clinical focus.\n\n\n**Analyzing Client Content**\n\nI\'m now analyzing the psychologist\'s core message and areas of expertise: helping people achieve life goals and manage issues like depression and anxiety. I\'ve noted his approach combines Psychoanalysis, Humanistic, Cognitive Behavioral Therapy, and Neurosciences, targeting adolescents and adults, with a focus on emotional intelligence, trauma, and self-esteem. I have also identified a set of specific tags for the content. I\'m assessing the skills needed to best present this information.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 56867105
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
