  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Creating the Approach Component**\n\nI\'ve just successfully crafted the Hero component. Now, I\'m shifting focus to developing the Approach component, specifically `/src/components/Approach.tsx`. It\'s crucial as it showcases the methodology: TCC of the 4th generation, which blends mindfulness, ACT, and neurobiology with Psican\303\241lise and Humanismo.\n\n\n**Designing the Approach Pillars**\n\nI\'m now diving into the core of the Approach component. I am structuring it around four key pillars: TCC of the 4th Generation, Behavioral Neuroscience, Psychoanalysis & Humble Gaze, and Compassionate Humanism. Each pillar will be broken down into a modular layout, to display its specific approach.\n\n\n"
