  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Creating the Self-Assessment**\n\nI\'ve successfully finished building the interactive BreathingExercise, and now I\'m shifting focus to the next element: `/src/components/SelfAssessment.tsx`. The goal is to design an interactive self-care checkup, a wellness questionnaire, and I will be working on composing the questions.\n\n\n**Designing the Self-Assessment**\n\nI\'ve implemented the `SelfAssessment` component, structured as a progressive, interactive questionnaire. Each question advances with smooth transitions. I\'ve included scoring logic behind the scenes, and designed a premium feedback system with thresholds based on the score: Sutil (0-6), Moderado/Alerta (7-13), and Elevado/Cr\303\255tico (14-20). Finally, a call-to-action button is displayed to send the result summary to Dr. Bruno via WhatsApp.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 16
      nanos: 347254425
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
