m:text-xs text-luxury-gold-light tracking-widest font-sans font-medium uppercase mt-1\">\n                  PSIC\303\223LOGO | CRP 05/75885\n                </p>\n                <p className=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-luxury-text-muted mt-1.5 opacity-80\">\n                  (21) 97524-9514\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Visual sign with physical telephone to highlight real life representation */}\n              <span className=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#111]/90 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-mono text-[9px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <span className=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-ping\" />\n                Sess\303\265es Dispon\303\255veis\n              </span>\n            </div>"
